4 or 8 identical 72 pin TRUE PARITY FPM SIMMs.  
They MUST be installed as either 4 or 8.  If you use 8, the board will use
256 bit memory accesses, if you only use 4, the memory bus will be 128 bits.
Also, the memory must be TRUE Parity ( n*36 bit).  "Logic Parity" SIMMs will
not function.
Also EDO SIMMs will not function.
