Hello,
 
You might want to check to see if your Alpha Server is really a 2100A.  You
wont see it on the front cover, it will be on the back of the server like
and will read A500MP.  If you see this your have a 2100A and I hate to tell
you but its very hard to find a distro that will work on it.  So far only
Red Hat 6.2 has loaded on mine.  Other distros will support it but you must
make a custom kernel, thus you can just d/l the iso burn it on a cd and go.
Good luck!
 
