The crc error strikes me as a media problem...=20

Are the cd's you are using known good? =20

Also...I have seen hiccups on older cdroms trying to read cd-rw media. =
If by chance you burnt your own cd's on rw media and the cdrom is an old =
one you might burn a new set on cd-r or swap in a newer cdrom.

Good luck -

Phil!

